uffed out  before they started  alexei navalny tried to keep up his  campaigning from prison with his lawyers  posting messages on instagram but that's  now banned here and with navalny being  moved to a maximum security prison it's  unlikely we're going to hear from him  for many years  bernard smith al jazeera moscow
 

